{"ID":"20240205153700-79t817i","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153700-79t817i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153700-79t817i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206141014-4qakuv0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614113450-xud0jzb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240704152105-3dmgy93\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"371补14乳香","type":"doc","updated":"20240828142012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206141014-4qakuv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206141014-4qakuv0","updated":"20240206141024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产索马里、埃塞俄比亚、阿拉伯半岛及印度等地。\n【性状】\t多呈小形乳头状、泪滴状颗粒或不规则的小块，长0.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm，有时粘连成团块。淡黄色，常带轻微的绿色、蓝色或棕红色。半透明。表面有一层类白色粉尘，除去粉尘后，表面仍无光泽。质坚脆，断面蜡样，无光泽，亦有少数呈玻璃样光泽。气微芳香，味微苦。嚼之，初破碎成小块，迅即软化成胶块，粘附牙齿，唾液成为乳状，并微有香辣感。遇热则变软，烧之微有香气 (但不应有松香气)，冒黑烟，并遗留黑色残渣。与少量水共研，能形成白色乳状液。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，温。\n【功效】\t调气活血，定痛，追毒。治气血凝滞、心腹疼痛，痈疮肿毒，跌打损伤，痛经，产后瘀血刺痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206141014-2fvickb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206141014-2fvickb","updated":"20240206141014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206141014-jw9zxys.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163447-v1sqaof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163447-v1sqaof","updated":"20240205163447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香-20240205163447-9a62urs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704150654-rbtl4x1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704150654-rbtl4x1","updated":"20240704151555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704150814-r4hytgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704150814-r4hytgf","updated":"20240828141921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 604px;","style":"width: 594px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香1-20240704150814-qtweglu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 594px;\" parent-style=\"width: 604px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 590px;","style":"width: 580px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香2-20240704150912-hn7rziq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 580px;\" parent-style=\"width: 590px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704151257-xal0kc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704151257-xal0kc9","updated":"20240828141923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 551px;","style":"width: 541px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香7-20240704151830-1c10nm1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 541px;\" parent-style=\"width: 551px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 720px;","style":"width: 710px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香5-20240704151257-war51pd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 710px;\" parent-style=\"width: 720px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704151002-hq244qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704151002-hq244qj","updated":"20240828141924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 572px;","style":"width: 562px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香4-20240704151630-0cp7ly7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 562px;\" parent-style=\"width: 572px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 509px;","style":"width: 499px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香-20240704150654-quhyvdd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 499px;\" parent-style=\"width: 509px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240614114456-tek7it9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114456-tek7it9","updated":"20240828141926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 433px;","style":"width: 423px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香3-20240704151002-hyirz3w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 423px;\" parent-style=\"width: 433px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 843px;","style":"width: 833px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香8-20240704152005-mrj2wcs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 833px;\" parent-style=\"width: 843px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704152105-3dmgy93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704152105-3dmgy93","updated":"20240828141928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 717px;","style":"width: 707px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香9-20240704152105-ak03m0v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 707px;\" parent-style=\"width: 717px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614114456-ajnmc0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114456-ajnmc0m","updated":"20240704151924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 718px;","style":"width: 708px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乳香6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乳香6-20240704151918-iplqgp9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 708px;\" parent-style=\"width: 718px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614114456-pg0t9sf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114456-pg0t9sf","updated":"20240828142012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：乳香为乳香树的树脂。（橄榄科乳香树属植物乳香树、药胶香树及野乳香树等，以其树干皮部伤口渗出的油胶树脂入药。春夏均可采。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614114456-ab3y8g2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614114456-ab3y8g2"}},{"ID":"20240614114533-2foz24q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-2foz24q","updated":"20240614114539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-apnbxbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-apnbxbp","updated":"20240614114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西出天竺者色黄白，南出波斯等国者色紫赤。其树类松，以斤斫树，脂溢于外，结而成香，聚而成块，薰陆是总名。乳是薰陆之乳头，透明者滴孔，（新出未离沙石者）次为乳塌，（日久重叠不成乳头者）杂沙石者黑塌。今人多以枫脂杂之，但乳色紫赤，枫脂微白而黄，烧之亦可辨。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-3q4wj1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-3q4wj1l","updated":"20240614114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又水湿塌，乃水渍色败气变者，不堪用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-4tpsei3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-4tpsei3","updated":"20240614114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气微温，尝之无味。纯阳善窜。入手少阴兼入足厥阴足太阴经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-ac51oxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-ac51oxu","updated":"20240614114542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治活血伸筋定痛，疗风水毒肿，中风口噤不语。止霍乱，冲恶中邪气，心腹痛，止大肠泄癖，下气益精，补肾补腰膝，治肾气，疗折伤。（南海中浮炎洲出薰陆香，夷人采之。恒患狤[犭屈]兽啖之，此兽斫刺不死，以杖打之皮不伤，而骨碎乃死。观此则乳香之治折伤，由能活血止痛，亦其性然也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-yddaw58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-yddaw58","updated":"20240614114544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡痈疽诸毒，内消托里护心，煎膏止痛长肉。治女子血气并产难。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-d623tok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-d623tok","updated":"20240614114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得木气而兼火化，阳也。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-r8c0anh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-r8c0anh","updated":"20240614114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同诸香用，驱邪辟恶。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-ifrse6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-ifrse6g","updated":"20240614114545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同归芍用，调血催生。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-3e03v9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-3e03v9d","updated":"20240614114547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合二陈能补中益气，和四物能托里生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-uqz151n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-uqz151n","updated":"20240614114549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同紫地丁、白芨、白蔹、金银花、夏枯草、白芷、连翘、贝母、甘菊、甘草、穿山甲、没药，治一切痈疽疔肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-a52eofm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-a52eofm","updated":"20240614114551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同续断、牛膝、当归、红曲、地黄、丹皮、川芎、没药，治内伤胸胁作痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-y36ff5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-y36ff5c","updated":"20240614114553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同没药、泽兰、牛膝、黑豆、蒲黄、五灵脂、延胡、丹皮、山楂，治产后儿枕作痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-muuspc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-muuspc6","updated":"20240617115346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心气痛不可忍，乳香三两，真茶四两，为末，以腊月鹿血和丸，弹子大。每温醋化一丸，服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-rxrk1jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-rxrk1jn","updated":"20240614114556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑胎易产，乳香五钱，枳壳一两，为末，蜜丸梧子大。空心，酒下三十丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-p4ddplr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-p4ddplr","updated":"20240614114558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"难产催生，乳香朱砂等分，为末。麝香少许，酒服一钱，良久自下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-r7krbn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-r7krbn6","updated":"20240614114600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕乳香系南番树脂，得木气而兼火化，其气微温。而日华子谓为辛热，洁古且云纯阳，夫脂液皆禀水气以化，此味乃纯阳而无阴，以入人身血分，是专行化化之机以活血，即以致血分无穷之用者也。其主风水毒肿中风口噤，固因风脏即血脏，而止霍乱中恶心腹痛大肠泄澼等证，则是从血而达气，反由阴而化阳矣。至谓其下气益精补腰脊治肾气，则又达阳而归阴矣。盖此味入心，心主血脉，通十二经，与肾呼吸相应，能活血，则血以化而生，血生化而经脉和调。即能入肾之血海，而肾气由之以生化，气盛则化精，精盈则益气，此所谓治肾气益精而补肾者也。夫心属火，生血乃以达气，肾属水，生气乃以化血，此入手少阴由血而达气所由，能致其无穷之用乎。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-1lf7cbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-1lf7cbz","updated":"20240614114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痈疽已溃，不宜服。诸疮脓多时，未宜遽用。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-1czkq12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-1czkq12","updated":"20240614114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔辨治〕紫赤色者良。恐不可得，取黄色明莹者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114533-xplo62d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114533-xplo62d","updated":"20240614114533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"箬盛烘燥，灯草同擂。若合丸散，罗细和入。倘煎汤液，临熟加调。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114456-e4vkkva","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614114456-e4vkkva"}},{"ID":"20240614114510-uiboujx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114510-uiboujx","updated":"20240614114515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114510-3awgdms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114510-3awgdms","updated":"20240614114510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名薰陆香。味苦辛。性微温。无毒。得天三之气而兼地二之化以生。可升可降。阳也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114510-14jpzwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114510-14jpzwq","updated":"20240614114510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主风水毒肿。去恶气伏尸。瘾疹痒毒。（别录）治耳聋。中风口噤不语。妇人血气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114510-2m0khd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114510-2m0khd6","updated":"20240614114510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（之才）庵）【归经】入心脾二经。兼入肝经。为活血伸筋之品。（香窜归心苦温归肺辛温能通十二经）【前论】元素曰。香窜能入心经活血定痛。故为痈疽疮疡心腹痛要药。庵曰。其治癫狂者鳌按、赤白痢腹痛不止者。加入乳香无不效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114510-suaxeun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114510-suaxeun","updated":"20240614114510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【禁忌】经疏曰。痈疽已溃。不宜服。诸疮脓多时。未宜遽用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113448-dtbkiwi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113448-dtbkiwi"}},{"ID":"20240614114449-ma7z9a1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114449-ma7z9a1","updated":"20240614114453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114449-a5tb4w1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114449-a5tb4w1","updated":"20240614114449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名熏陆香．宣、活血舒筋．"}]},{"ID":"20240614114449-37k2kmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114449-37k2kmf","updated":"20240614114449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦温．辛香善窜．入心．通行十二经．能去风伸筋．（筋不伸者、敷药加用．）调气活血．"}]},{"ID":"20240614114449-y6sywm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114449-y6sywm1","updated":"20240614114449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"托里护心．（香彻疮孔、能使毒瓦斯外出、不致内攻．）生肌止痛．治心腹诸痛．口噤耳聋．痈疽疮肿．产难折伤．（皆取其活血止痛．）亦治癫狂．（能去风散瘀、沈存中灵苑方、辰砂散、辰砂一两、乳香枣仁各五钱、酒下、恣饮沉醉、听睡一二日、勿动、惊醒则不可治、本事方、加人参一两、名宁志膏．）止泄痢．疮疽已溃勿服．脓多勿敷．出诸番．圆大如乳头、明透者良．（今松脂枫脂中、亦有此状者、市人或以伪之．）性粘难研．水飞过．用钵坐热水中．以灯心同研．则易细．（山居四要、玉茎作痛、乳香葱白等分、捣敷．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113448-nzhjtyh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113448-nzhjtyh"}},{"ID":"20240614114440-evestt5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114440-evestt5","updated":"20240614114444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114440-1ipuork","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114440-1ipuork","updated":"20240614114440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得木气而兼火化，苦辛，微温，无毒。入足太阴，手少阴，兼入厥阴经，故其所治皆三经之病也。箬上烘去油，同灯芯研则细。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114440-wot1oa4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114440-wot1oa4","updated":"20240614114440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香诸经卒痛，心腹急痛，诸般恶疮，一切肿毒，一切疼痛，恶痢殊痛，刮肠痛风，异常楚毒，护心活血解毒生肌，产科亦用。然乳香功专生血而主心，没药功专散血而主肝。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114440-ehkmjme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114440-ehkmjme","updated":"20240614114440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 去恶气，调气血，定诸经之痛，内消肿毒，外治毒瓦斯，性能伸筋，故筋不伸者，敷药必用也。凡痘后余毒，诸疮溃痈生肌止痛皆用，然疮痈已溃者勿服。脓血过多者勿敷，以其辛香走窜气血，更有利水淡渗之功耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114359-54gc4lm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614114359-54gc4lm"}},{"ID":"20240614114429-cms5l0p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114429-cms5l0p","updated":"20240614114435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114429-on7qy75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114429-on7qy75","updated":"20240614114429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和营定痛．活络舒筋．香窜入心．辛温兼苦．（乳香出诸番波斯等国．树脂也．辛苦性温．其香润之质．能入心脾营分．和营舒筋．活血定痛．内用外用．其理一也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614114359-vdpie3x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614114359-vdpie3x"}},{"ID":"20240614114419-62yj71q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114419-62yj71q","updated":"20240614114425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114419-9ltngkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114419-9ltngkd","updated":"20240614114419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛、苦、温。入手少阴经气分。去风伸筋，活血除痛，并疗痘后余毒，并治跌打损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114419-jol8vhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114419-jol8vhk","updated":"20240614114419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得胆矾，烧研，敷甲疽努肉。得鹿血、真茶，治心腹气痛。配绿豆、朱砂，研调水服，托里护心。（毒瓦斯外出，不致内侵。）佐枣仁，治胆虚不眠。佐枳壳，令胎滑易产。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114419-2hjmqtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114419-2hjmqtv","updated":"20240614114419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"箬上烘去油，同灯心研则细。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114359-rbnt4g5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614114359-rbnt4g5"}},{"ID":"20240614114410-8ote9bn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114410-8ote9bn","updated":"20240614114413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114410-6rgms7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114410-6rgms7f","updated":"20240614114410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（香木）入心行气活血止痛"}]},{"ID":"20240614114410-21abwhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114410-21abwhv","updated":"20240614114410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香（专入心。兼入脾胃肾）。即书所云熏陆香者是也。香窜性温不润。诸书曷言于血有补。讵知血因气逆。则血凝而不通。以致心腹绞痛。毒因气滞。则血聚而不散。以致痛楚异常。乳香香窜入心。既能使血宣通而筋不伸。（杨瘦清云。凡人筋不伸者。敷药宜加乳香。其性能伸筋。）复能入肾温补。使气与血互相通活。俾气不令血阻。血亦不被气碍。故云功能生血。究皆行气活血之品耳。非如没药气味苦平。功专破血散瘀。止有推陈之力。而无致新之妙。是以书载乳香功能活血调气。托里护心。（用入疮孔。能使毒瓦斯外出。不致内攻也。）生肌止痛。治心腹诸痛。口噤耳聋。（口噤。烧烟以熏。）痈肿折伤癫狂。（治癫狂。用灵仙辰砂乳香枣仁酒下。恣饮沉醉。听睡。或加人参内入。名宁志膏。）但遇痈疽已溃。及脓血过多者。不可妄投。恐其复开走泄之路。其意已可见矣。岂若当归辛润。而为补血第一要药也。出诸番。如乳头。明透者良。惟粘难研。水飞过。用钵坐热水研之。或用灯心同研。则易细。市人多以枫香伪售。勿用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114359-ha6e8ts","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614114359-ha6e8ts"}},{"ID":"20240614114400-cn5r3sp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-cn5r3sp","updated":"20240614114405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-wwa4wd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-wwa4wd1","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治。活血。舒筋。下气。益精生肌。止痛。托里护心。霍乱瘟疫。中风。口噤。风水肿毒。癫狂不眠。瘾疹耳聋。心腹痛大肠泄。淋癃溺血。肾气。遗精。茎肿。（同葱白捣敷）妇人血气。难产。疗折伤痈疽杖疮。乳香丸。乳香二十两。苦参（锉）四两。好酒四升。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-ye5ilgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-ye5ilgz","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浸苦参瓶内。重汤慢火煎一伏时。滤去滓。再入乳香于砂锅内。煎如饧。加天麻末四两。大麻仁（另研如膏）二两。搅匀。慢火熬丸梧子大。每服二十丸。空腹晚食。大麻仁酒下。治疠风。又方。乳香没药夏蚕砂草乌各五钱。五灵脂二钱木鳖子五枚。研末酒煮面糊丸梧子大。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-tm20s19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-tm20s19","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每服七丸。薄荷汤下。治头目痛血攻筋急身疼。又方。乳香轻粉砒各五分。麝香少许。先研乳香入他药末研匀。用薄纸一韭叶阔。按药揉纸少许丸如黄米大。临卧以药填患处。至明愈。治走马牙疳。忌盐醋等物。又方。乳香没药（均另研）羌活五灵脂独活各三钱。川芎。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-d11ga63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-d11ga63","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当归绿豆粉交趾桂白芷白胶香各五钱。研末蜜丸弹子大。每服一丸。细嚼。薄荷煎汤下。治发背。一切疮疽溃烂。痛不可忍。如手足挹痛不能起者。加川乌。用木瓜盐汤送下。又方。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-dvodzy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-dvodzy2","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香五分。沉香没药各一钱。蝎梢十四枚。鸡心槟榔一钱五分。研末蜜丸梧子大。每服二丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-j5nm8ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-j5nm8ll","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"菖蒲钩藤汤调下。治小儿惊风内钓。腹痛惊啼。乳香搜风丸。乳香三斤。（河水添换煮四五次。川乌十两捣碎煎汁一钵。入乳香煎。至汁干。再用防风石菖蒲荆芥苍术各四两煎汁一钵。入乳香煮汁干。又用石菖蒲四斤煎汁一钵。入乳香煮干。每制乳香一斤。配药一斗。）升麻牛蒡子胡麻白藓皮连翘苦参桑寄生当归怀生地秦艽枸杞子槟榔何首乌各四两。鳖甲一个。（重一两佳）凌霄花川芎大风肉（去油同川乌煎）防己虎胫骨（炙酥）陈皮牛膝甘菊紫草海风藤木瓜各二两。杜仲白芷各一两二钱。甘草一两五钱。薏仁六两。芝麻二合。用鲜皂角刺三斤。捣碎清煎去滓。熬成膏。入前药捣丸梧子大。初服一钱五分。三日后加五分。至三钱止。治血痹痛风。及诸风。服至二十日。伸指酸麻。一月容光焕发。百日愈。乳豆丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-q5be27f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-q5be27f","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香生肉豆蔻。（另研）以乳香用酒浸研成膏。和蔻末为丸梧子大。每服五十丸。空腹米汤下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-zqcz4r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-zqcz4r9","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治滑泄不止。诸药无效。乳香定痛散乳香没药（均去油）各五钱。滑石一两。冰片一钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-kjumf32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-kjumf32","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葱汁调搽。治一切痈疽伤损溃烂疼痛。或加南星半夏蓖麻仁尤佳。又方。乳香没药各五钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-j3quocc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-j3quocc","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎白芷赤芍丹皮生地各七钱五分。炙草二钱。为散。每服四钱。醇酒童便调下。治跌扑伤筋疼痛。大便不通加大黄。（酒制）乳香消毒散。乳香没药栝蒌各五钱。大黄（煨）黄牛蒡子（炒）银花牡蛎（盐泥煨）各五两。甘草三两。为末。每服五钱。水煎。疮在上食后服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-96yjlc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-96yjlc6","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在下食前服。治恶疮。乳香散。乳香没药（均去油）各三钱。自然铜（醋淬七次）当归各五钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-239m2d5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-239m2d5","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茴香四钱。为散。每服五钱。温酒调下。治杖疮。又方。乳香防风荆芥川芎白芷细辛本羌活白菊石菖蒲天麻蔓荆子瓜蒂赤小豆防己菟丝子谷精草自然铜（制）郁金当归石膏（）没药雄黄蛇蜕（炒焦）蝉蜕（炒焦）穿山甲鸡子蜕（均烧）龙脑薄荷各五分。麝香片脑各五厘。研末。每用少许吹入鼻中。治内外障眼。攀睛瘀肉。倒睫卷毛。翳膜遮睛。一切目疾。又方。乳香腻粉各五分。黄柏龙骨大黄各三钱。麝香一字。研末。先以苦竹沥洗疮。拭干掺药。治远年恶疮。又方。乳香古半两钱各五分。紫藤香五钱。轻粉麝香（当门子）各少许。研末。每用少许。先以甘草汤洗患处。拭干敷药。即以灯草塞之。治嵌甲。又方。乳香一钱。（荷叶包炭火上炙令半融放地上另研）肉豆蔻白姜炙草草果各一两。细锉。醋和面粉裹热灰内煨令赤色取出去面研末。入乳香末拌匀。每服五分或一钱。陈米汤调下。治一切泻痢。乳香趁痛散。乳香三两。虎胫骨（酒炙黄）败龟板（酒炙）各二两。血竭赤芍当归没药防风自然铜（醋淬细研）白附子（泡）辣桂白芷苍耳子（微炒）骨碎补（炒去毛）各三两。牛膝天麻槟榔五加皮羌活各一两。研末。每服一钱。温酒调下。治打坠腰痛香港脚。或加全蝎。乳香黄散乳香没药（均去油）各五钱。黄当归（酒洗）川芎麻黄生草节白芍人参罂粟壳（去筋蜜炙）陈皮各一两。研末。每服三钱。水煎治一切恶疮。痈疽。发背疔肿。打扑损伤。筋骨疼痛。疮在上食后服。在下食前服。未成即消。已成即溃。乳香盏落散。乳香三钱。御米壳（去蒂）四两。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-j3veif9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-j3veif9","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈皮炙草桔梗柴胡各一两。研末。每服三钱。加灯芯十茎。水煎服。治偏正头痛。乳香护心散。乳香一两。绿豆粉四两。朱砂三钱。研末。每服二钱。甘草汤调下。治痈疽。疔疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-r19ao1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-r19ao1m","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶疮。喉舌生疮。预服防毒攻心。乳香膏。乳香没药川芎自然铜各七钱。当归羌活独活牛膝石膏。刘寄奴黑牵牛黄柏皮破故纸白胶香生地熟地赤芍白芍紫金皮黄丹白芷各五钱。黄蜡一两清油四两。除丹胶香蜡外。余研末入油煎。柳枝不住手搅试。将成膏却入三味。更试成膏。以生布滤净瓦器盛水。倾入水内。用篦摊开。治金疮杖疮贴患处。深者捻成膏条入孔中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114400-7fzm0tb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114400-7fzm0tb","updated":"20240614114400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作热者加轻粉片脑朴硝。入膏内贴之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113449-b4hauvu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113449-b4hauvu"}},{"ID":"20240614114347-9dml73r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114347-9dml73r","updated":"20240614114351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114347-txbqhm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114347-txbqhm4","updated":"20240614114347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"一名熏陆香"}]},{"ID":"20240614114347-ey59g41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114347-ey59g41","updated":"20240614114347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宣，活血，伸筋"}]},{"ID":"20240614114347-80m1u8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114347-80m1u8g","updated":"20240614114347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"香窜入心，苦温补肾，辛温通十二经。能去风伸筋（筋不伸者，敷药加用），活血调气，托里护心（香彻疮孔，能使毒瓦斯外出，不致内攻），生肌止痛。治心腹诸痛，口噤耳聋，痈疽疮肿，产难折伤（皆取其活血止痛）。亦治癫狂（以能去风散瘀。灵苑辰砂散，辰砂一两，乳香、枣仁各五钱，酒下。恣饮沉醉，听睡一二日勿动，惊醒则不可治。《本事》加人参一两，名宁志膏）。出诸番。如乳头、明透者良（市人多以枫香伪之）。性粘难研，水飞过，用钵坐热水中研之，或用灯心同研则易细。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113449-m6aokut","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113449-m6aokut"}},{"ID":"20240614114326-t2y1gzj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114326-t2y1gzj","updated":"20240614114330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草害利》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114326-k4sugqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114326-k4sugqo","updated":"20240614114326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名熏陆香"}]},{"ID":"20240614114326-2qj8zeo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114326-2qj8zeo","updated":"20240614114326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔害〕辛香善窜，疮疽己溃勿服，及诸疮脓多勿敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114326-oug3ezz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114326-oug3ezz","updated":"20240614114326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔利〕辛温入心，通行十二经，活血舒筋，和气治痢，托里生肌，定诸经之痛，解诸疮之毒，护心，外宣毒瓦斯，是有奇功也。产难斫伤，亦治癫狂，能祛风散瘀。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114326-pne3u0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114326-pne3u0z","updated":"20240614114326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕出诸番，圆大如乳头，明透者良，性粘难研，水沸过用钵坐热水中，以灯心同研则易细。今松脂枫脂中亦有此状者，市人或以伪之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113449-scjnign","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113449-scjnign"}},{"ID":"20240614114311-u5wc9bf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114311-u5wc9bf","updated":"20240614114315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114311-sq1blcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114311-sq1blcx","updated":"20240614114311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240614114311-04y8np4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114311-04y8np4","updated":"20240614114311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微温无毒．纯阳入手少阴心经．"}]},{"ID":"20240614114311-zskpwp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114311-zskpwp6","updated":"20240614114311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240614114311-e7srcy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114311-e7srcy5","updated":"20240614114311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"活血定痛．疗风水毒肿瘾疹痒毒．止霍乱中恶．中邪气．托理护心．活血伸筋．治妇人产难折伤．盖乳香香窜能入心经．故内托护心散用之透彻疮孔中．使毒瓦斯外出．不致内攻也．"}]},{"ID":"20240614113449-45jb38e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113449-45jb38e"}},{"ID":"20240614114252-ufibtwx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114252-ufibtwx","updated":"20240614114257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114252-wf1gqgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114252-wf1gqgz","updated":"20240614114252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香，味辛、苦，气温，阳也，无毒。入脾、肺、心、肝、肾五脏。疗诸般恶疮及风水肿毒，定诸经卒痛并心腹急疼。亦入散膏，止痛长肉。更催生产。且理风邪，内外科皆可用。大约内治止痛，实为圣药，研末调服尤神。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114252-fs5ca72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114252-fs5ca72","updated":"20240614114252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问诸痛皆属于火，而乳香性温，宜与痛病不相合，何以定诸经之卒痛耶？盖乳香气虽温，而味实苦，温为热，苦为寒。气温则先入于火之中，相合而不相碍；味苦则后居于痛之内，相制而不相违。此所以能定诸痛，而无不宜也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113449-kt6or96","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113449-kt6or96"}},{"ID":"20240614114236-cfqq785","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614114236-cfqq785","updated":"20240614114240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614114236-fehs81d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114236-fehs81d","updated":"20240614114236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香辛温善止痛，疗诸风疮及风中，消肿止泻定霍乱，补肾催生俱要用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614114236-9g75ied","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614114236-9g75ied","updated":"20240614114236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形似乳头，即波斯国松木脂也。纯阳，无毒。能调气血，定诸经之痛，内而心腹骨节，外而疮疡痈疽疼痛者必用之。疗诸风疮、瘾疹、痒毒，入药服之则内消，煎膏贴之则生肌。又治中风口噤不语，消风水毒肿，止大肠泄 ，定霍乱，补肾益精，暖腰膝，下肾气，妇人难产，催生下死，小儿急慢惊风，俱要药也。紫赤如樱桃者上，枫香、松脂多可混之，烧之乃辨真伪。入丸、散，微炒，杀毒。得不粘，或捣碎纸包，席下眠一宿，另研。一法，用时以缯袋挂于窗隙间，良久取研之乃不粘。又熏陆香亦其类也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113449-42qc18g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113449-42qc18g"}},{"ID":"20240614113514-nkxtjol","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-nkxtjol","updated":"20240614114116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-oyphc1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-oyphc1z","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】橄榄科矮小乔木卡氏乳香树BoswelliacarteriiBirdw.胶树脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-24w3jv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-24w3jv1","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】辛、苦，温。归心、肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-n939xol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-n939xol","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】活血止痛，消肿生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-42qirgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-42qirgs","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于脘腹疼痛，风湿痹痛，跌痡伤痛，经行腹痛等病症"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-ycsjgkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-ycsjgkw","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香辛散温通，功能活血，具有良好的止痛作用，且作用广泛，适用于瘀阻疼痛的症候。在配伍应用方面，每与没药相须为用，若是脘腹疼痛，有可配伍川楝子、延胡索等同用；用治风湿痹痛，有可配伍祛风湿药如羌活、秦艽等；跌扑伤痛、经行腹痛，可与当归、川芎等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-5e08mfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-5e08mfm","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于疮疡肿痛或溃后久不收口"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-7f3wd49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-7f3wd49","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香又为治疗疮疡要药，既能消肿止痛而治疮疡肿痛，又能生肌敛疮而用于溃破不敛之症。内服治疮疡肿痛，多配麝香、雄黄等同用；外用治疮疡溃破，常与没药同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-nd9y6l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-nd9y6l6","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】生乳香滴乳香（原药敲碎用）、乳香制乳香炒乳香（炒去油用）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-jop2im7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-jop2im7","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一钱至三钱，煎服。外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-f0h7tr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-f0h7tr8","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【按语】1.乳香辛苦而温，入心肝脾，活血止痛，善治心腹疼痛与经行腹痛等症；消肿生肌能医窗疡肿痛与跌扑伤痛之候。为内外妇伤诸科要药唯气有异香，易败胃气，每能引起恶心呕吐，用者当慎。虽有生制两者，内服多用制过者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-4dyok7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-4dyok7f","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.乳香与没药两药功效相同，临床配合应用具有相须之功。或称两者区别，乳香长于行气，没药长于活血，又云乳香兼能舒筋活络，没药则活血祛瘀独擅其长，咸渺范之见，有待研究者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113514-vqnploh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113514-vqnploh","updated":"20240614113514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】海浮散（《医学心悟》）乳香、没药。外敷疮疡，腐肉自化，新肉自生，能拔毒收口。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113449-ozi5wak","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113449-ozi5wak"}},{"ID":"20240614113450-grqfks6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-grqfks6","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：乳香"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-h5lb7du","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-h5lb7du","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-w2mtep5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-w2mtep5","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Rǔ Xiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-lrtmpbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-lrtmpbg","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-qtcuevm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-qtcuevm","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 滴乳香、熏陆香"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-f7q35op","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-f7q35op","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-gjtsn7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-gjtsn7k","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 橄榄科乳香树属植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乳香树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Boswellia carterii Birdw.[B. sacra Fluek.]、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药胶香树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B. bhawdajiana Birdw.及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"野乳香树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B. neglecta M. Moore等，以其树干皮部伤口渗出的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"油胶树脂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。春夏均可采。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-cfl9trp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-cfl9trp","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-qpq8gtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-qpq8gtw","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 呈球形或泪滴状颗粒，或不规则小块状，长0.5～2厘米；淡黄色，微带蓝绿色或棕红色，半透明。质坚脆，断面腊样。气芳香，味微苦，嚼之软化成胶块。本品遇水变白，与水共研成乳状液。部分溶于醚、乙醇及氯仿中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-7vcumoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-7vcumoa","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-q92lf6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-q92lf6g","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 捣成粉末，于锅内炒溶后，除净大量的刺激性浓烟（即挥发油），倒出待微冷后，切成小块即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-xud0jzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-xud0jzb","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-8muplrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-8muplrz","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛、苦，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-4yz5sy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-4yz5sy7","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-mxg87cz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-mxg87cz","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 活血止痛。用于心腹诸痛，筋脉拘挛，跌打损伤，疮痈肿痛；外用消肿生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-h5m23tp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-h5m23tp","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-qtf5bxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-qtf5bxv","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～3钱；外用适量，配入散剂或膏剂，敷贴患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-m2kd58z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-m2kd58z","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-o2d8cci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-o2d8cci","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"熏陆香"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亦称"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乳香"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，商品也作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乳香"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。为漆树科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"粘胶乳香树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pistacia Lentiscus L.的树干经切伤后流出的树脂。主产于希腊、土耳其及地中海南岸地区。西医用为填齿料，并为制硬膏的原料，中医作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乳香"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ujk3wgt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ujk3wgt","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-k701qsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-k701qsv","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-y15f2pb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-y15f2pb","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：乳香"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-53y87ie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-53y87ie","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ovvkbyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ovvkbyt","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Rǔ Xiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-j4vl4zq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-j4vl4zq","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-91yk8al","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-91yk8al","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 熏陆香（《别录》），马尾香、乳头香（《海药本草》），塌香（《梦溪笔谈》），西香（《本草衍义》），天泽香、摩勒香、多伽罗香、浴香（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-84c2jou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-84c2jou","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-4lbntpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-4lbntpx","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-8nbhymp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-8nbhymp","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-oodbl64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-oodbl64","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为橄榄科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卡氏乳香树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胶树脂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春、夏均可采收，以春季为盛产期。采收时，干树干的皮部由下向上顺序切伤，并开一狭沟，使树脂从伤口渗出，流入沟中，数天后凝成干硬的固体，即可采取。落于地面者常粘附砂土杂质，品质较次。本品性粘，宜密闭，防尘；遇热则软化变色，故宜贮藏于阴凉处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-dgkvshv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-dgkvshv","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-dxvg940","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-dxvg940","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 分布红海沿岸至利比亚、苏丹、土耳其等地。主产于红海沿岸的索马里和埃塞俄比亚。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-7d75yvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-7d75yvh","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-06r3on2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-06r3on2","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 矮小灌木，高4～5米，罕达6米。树干粗壮，树皮光滑，淡棕黄色，纸状，粗枝的树皮鳞片状，逐渐剥落。叶互生，密集或于上部疏生，单数羽状复叶，长15～25厘米，叶柄被白毛；小叶7～10对，对生，无柄，基部者最小，向上渐大，小叶片长卵形，长达3.5厘米，顶端者长达7.5厘米，宽1.5厘米，先端钝，基部圆形、近心形或截形，边缘有不规则的圆齿裂，或近全缘，两面均被白毛，或上面无毛。花小，排列成稀疏的总状花序；苞片卵形：花萼杯状，先端5裂，裂片三角状卵形；花瓣5片，淡黄色，卵形，长约为萼片的2倍，先端急尖；雄蕊10，着生于花盘外侧，花丝短；子房上位，3～4室，每室具2垂生胚珠，柱头头状，略3裂。桉果倒卵形，长约1厘米，有三棱，钝头，果皮肉质，肥厚，每室具种子1枚。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-k0fifvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-k0fifvk","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-yq9fft7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-yq9fft7","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥胶树脂，多呈小形乳头状、泪滴状颗粒或不规则的小块，长0.5～3厘米，有时粘连成团块。淡黄色，常带轻微的绿色、蓝色或棕红色。半透明。表面有一层类白色粉尘，除去粉尘后，表面仍无光泽。质坚脆，断面蜡样，无光择，亦有少数呈玻璃样光泽。气微芳香，味微苦。嚼之，初破碎成小块，迅即软化成胶块，粘附牙齿，唾液成为乳状，并微有香辣感。遇热则变软，烧之微有香气（但不应有松香气），冒黑烟，并遗留黑色残渣。与少量水共研，能形成白色乳状液。以淡黄色、颗粒状、半透明、无砂石树皮杂质、粉末粘手、气芳香者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-93857lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-93857lg","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-sgzrtjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-sgzrtjo","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含树脂60～70％，树胶27～35％，挥发油3～8％。树脂的主要成分为游离α、β-乳香脂酸33％，结合乳香脂酸1.5％，乳香树脂烃33％。树胶为阿糖酸的钙盐和镁盐20％，西黄芪胶粘素6％；此外，尚含苦味质0.5％。挥发油呈淡黄色，有芳香，含蒎烯，消旋-柠檬烯及α、β-水芹烯，其主要的芳香成分未明。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-3ow58so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-3ow58so","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-velnxst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-velnxst","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 乳香：拣去砂子杂质。制乳香：取拣净的乳香，置锅内用文火炒至表面稍见熔化点，略呈黄色，取出放凉；或炒至表面溶化时，喷洒米醋，继续炒至外层明亮光透，取出放凉。（每乳香100斤，用米醋6斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ilbgx0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ilbgx0p","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"凡使（乳香），置箬上，以灰火烘焙熔化，候冷，研细用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-oi66ug6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-oi66ug6","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"乳香入丸药，以少酒研如泥，以水飞过，晒干用；或言以灯心同研则易细，或言以糯米数粒同研，或言以人指甲二、三片同研，或言以乳钵坐热水中乳之，皆易细。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-0a9lqwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-0a9lqwa","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-hpr92wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-hpr92wc","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入心、肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-yje5lb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-yje5lb1","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①朱震亨：\"入手少阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-nui6p1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-nui6p1l","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入足太阴、手少阴，兼入足厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-st3q9ds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-st3q9ds","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-gb7bw4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-gb7bw4a","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛苦，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-81etpjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-81etpjn","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-y11hcrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-y11hcrf","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《日华子本草》：\"味辛，热，微毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-xsi2r57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-xsi2r57","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③李杲：\"味苦辛，热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-nyaglxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-nyaglxg","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-5y5fd7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-5y5fd7c","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-xrgulgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-xrgulgb","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"痈疽已溃不宜服，诸疮脓多时，未宜遽用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-bn7wvzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-bn7wvzc","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"胃弱勿用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-o1nv1rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-o1nv1rw","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-z493kbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-z493kbe","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 调气活血，定痛，追毒。治气血凝滞、心腹疼痛，痈疮肿毒，跌打损伤，痛经，产后瘀血刺痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-yni9ayn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-yni9ayn","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"疗风水毒肿，去恶气。\"\"疗风瘾疹痒毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-4hdrivk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-4hdrivk","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草拾遗》：\"疗耳聋，中风口噤，妇人血气，能发酒，理风冷，止大肠泄澼，疗诸疮令内消。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-85soz0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-85soz0a","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"止霍乱，心腹痛。煎膏止痛长肉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-hlsd09x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-hlsd09x","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《证类本草》：\"治不眠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-z08yc54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-z08yc54","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《珍珠囊》：\"定诸经之痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-nsti19n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-nsti19n","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"消痈疽诸毒，托里护心，活血定痛，伸筋，治妇人难产，折伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-tdm1cie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-tdm1cie","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草从新》：\"治癫狂，止泄痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-xukd5gy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-xukd5gy","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《要药分剂》：\"赤白痢腹痛不止者，加入乳香无不效。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ydt4168","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ydt4168","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-iqqsdet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-iqqsdet","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或入丸，散。外用：研末凋敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ap6q6wh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ap6q6wh","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-c8x1j93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-c8x1j93","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治心气疼痛不可忍：乳香三两，真茶四两。为末，以腊月鹿血和丸，弹子大。每温醋化一丸服之。（《瑞竹堂经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-nssy0xf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-nssy0xf","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治急心痛：胡椒四十九粒，乳香一钱，为末，男用姜汤下，女用当归汤下。（《摄生众妙方》抽刀散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-fdm3697","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-fdm3697","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治气血凝滞，痃癖症瘕，心腹疼痛，腿酸臂疼，内外疮疡，一切脏腑积聚，经络湮淤：当归五钱，丹参五钱，生明乳香五钱，生明没药五钱。上药四味作汤服，若为散，一剂分作四次服，温酒送下。（《医学衷中参西录》活络效灵丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-dkmjdvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-dkmjdvb","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治产后瘀滞不清，攻刺心腹作痛：乳香、没药（俱瓦上焙出油）各三钱，五灵脂、延胡索、牡丹皮、桂枝各五钱（俱炒黄），黑豆一两（炒成烟炭）。共为末，每服三钱，生姜泡汤调下。（《李念先手集》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-t5vvwtu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-t5vvwtu","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治跌扑折伤筋骨：乳香，真没药各一钱五分，当归尾，红花、桃仁各三钱。水煎服。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-39u0obm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-39u0obm","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治发背脑疽，和一切恶疮内溃及诸恶毒冲心呕痛：乳香一两（通明者，用水外浸，以乳钵研细），真绿豆粉（研）叫两。上二味合研极细，每服一钱匕，新水调下，水不可多，要药在胸膈上也。（《圣济总录》托里汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-e4ogre8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-e4ogre8","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治疮疡疼痛不可忍：乳香、没药各二钱，寒水石（煅）、滑石各四钱，冰片一分。为细末，搽患处。（《外科发挥》乳香定痛散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-1as1ic8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-1as1ic8","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治鱼肚痈及翻花起肛，久烂不堪者，消肿止痛：乳香、没药（各去油）各一两，麝香一钱半，雄精五钱（各研极细），黄米饭二两。捣烂为丸，如莱菔子大，忌火烘，晒干。每服陈酒送下三钱，醉盖取汗。（《外科全生集》醒消丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-flt1pe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-flt1pe9","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治化脓性指头炎，急性乳腺炎：乳香五钱，白矾、花椒各二钱，葱白数根。水煎外洗，一日数次。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-tsepc6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-tsepc6j","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治阴寒呃忒不止：乳香、硫黄，艾各二钱。为细末，用好酒一钟，煎数沸，乘热气，使病人鼻嗅之。外用捣生姜擦胸前。（《伤寒全生集》乳香硫黄散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-wvc8cjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-wvc8cjg","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治梦寐遗精：乳香一块，拇指大，卧时嚼，含至三更，咽下。三、五服。（《医林集要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-qy4bbxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-qy4bbxu","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治口目歪斜：乳香烧烟熏之，以顺其血脉。（《证治要诀》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-gbixxjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-gbixxjk","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治咽喉骨哽：乳香一钱，水研服之。（《卫生易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-7o90jmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-7o90jmh","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治齿虫痛不可忍：嚼熏陆香咽其汁。（《梅师集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-0f89w0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-0f89w0a","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-cz86vd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-cz86vd2","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"乳香香窜，入心经，活血定痛，故为痈疽疮疡、心腹痛要药。《素问》云：诸痛痒疮疡，皆属心火是矣。产科诸方多用之，亦取其活血之功尔。……杨清叟云：凡人筋不伸者，敷药宜加乳香，其性能伸筋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-answu1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-answu1a","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"风水毒肿，邪干心脾，恶气内侵，亦由二经虚而邪易犯。瘾疹痒毒，总因心脾为风湿热邪所干致之。脾主肌肉，而痛痒疮疡皆属心火，此药正入二经，辛香能散一切留结，则诸证自瘳矣。《日华子》云，煎膏止痛长肉；陈藏器云，治妇人血气，疗诸疮，令内消。则今人用以治内伤诸痛，及肿毒内服外敷之药，有自来矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-9t4tf3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-9t4tf3s","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"乳香，活血去风，舒筋止痛之药也。陈氏发明云，香烈走窜，故入疡科，方用极多。又跌扑斗打，折伤筋骨，又产后气血攻刺，心腹疼痛，恒用此，咸取其香辛走散，散血排脓，通气化滞为专功也。故痈疡可理，折伤可续，产后瘀血留滞可行，癥块痞积，伏血冷瘕可去矣，性燥气烈，去风活血，追毒定痛，除痈疡、产后及伤筋骨之外，皆不须用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-bquqeq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-bquqeq7","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草求真》：\"血因气逆，则血凝而不通，以至心腹绞痛；毒因气滞，则血聚而不散，以至痛处异常。乳香香窜入心，既能使血宣通而筋自伸，复能入肾温补，使气与血互相通活，俾气不令血阻，血亦不被气碍，故云功能生血，究皆行气活血之品耳。非如没药气味苦乎，功专破血散瘀，止有推陈之力，而无致新之妙。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-56pb2qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-56pb2qz","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《医学衷中参西录》：\"乳香、没药，二药并用，为宣通脏腑、流通经络之要药，故凡心胃胁腹肢体关节诸疼痛皆能治之。又善治女子行经腹疼，产后瘀血作痛，月事不以时下。其通气活血之力，又善治风寒湿痹，周身麻木，四肢不遂及一切疮疡肿疼，或其疮硬不疼。外用为粉以敷疮疡，能解毒，消肿、生肌、止疼，虽为开通之品，不至耗伤气血，诚良药也。\"\"乳香、没药，最宜生用，若炒用之则其流通之力顿减，至用于丸散中者，生轧作粗渣入锅内，隔纸烘至半熔，侯冷轧之即成细末，此乳香、没药去油之法。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-q3f1xt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-q3f1xt7","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-pbmxng5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-pbmxng5","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 此外，尚有同属植物鲍达乳香树及野乳香树等数种。所产乳香，形状均与上种相似。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-nqqi7t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-nqqi7t0","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-nja05cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-nja05cp","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-elrph3l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-elrph3l","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：乳香"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-bm09l2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-bm09l2x","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-006tg7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-006tg7s","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Rǔ Xiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-gjv2m9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-gjv2m9z","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-1naobe3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-1naobe3","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 乳头香、塌香、马思答吉、天泽香、摩勒香、杜噜香、多伽罗香、浴香。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-d8znpz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-d8znpz4","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-bv2u0z2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-bv2u0z2","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Frankincense, Olibanum"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-114ap4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-114ap4m","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-pb7naxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-pb7naxr","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《名医别录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-t7r1qxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-t7r1qxz","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《南方草木状》：熏陆香，出大秦，在海边。有大树，枝叶正如古松，生于沙中，盛夏，树胶流出沙上，方采之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-56w18ed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-56w18ed","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-3q2gr9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-3q2gr9q","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为橄榄科植物乳香树、鲍达乳香树、野乳香树等皮部渗出的油胶树脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-oh52rkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-oh52rkh","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Boswellia carterii Birdw.2.Boswellia bhawdajiana Birdw.3.Boswellia neglecta M.Moore"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-2p9b1e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-2p9b1e3","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春、夏季均可采收，以春季为盛产期。采收时，于树干的皮部由下向上顺序切伤，并开一狭沟，使树脂从伤口渗出，流人沟中，数日后汇成干硬的固体，即可采取。落于地面者常粘附砂土杂质，品质较次。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-lz8c5nu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-lz8c5nu","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-3gekkyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-3gekkyu","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生于热带沿海山地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ze0ehsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ze0ehsp","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.以上两种均生长于索马里及红海沿海的山地及石灰岩石地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-4rjbro9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-4rjbro9","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于红海沿岸至利比亚、苏丹、土耳其等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-fu48w45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-fu48w45","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于两种均生长于索马里、埃塞俄比亚及阿拉伯半岛南部以及土耳其、利比亚及苏丹等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-eg60ds1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-eg60ds1","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-70sg0ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-70sg0ah","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1．乳香树 矮小灌木，高4-5m，稀达6m。树干粗壮，树皮光滑，淡棕黄色，纸状，粗枝的树皮鳞片状，逐渐剥落。奇数羽状复叶互生，长15-25cm；小叶15-21，基部者最小，向上渐大，长卵形，长达3.5cm，顶端者长达7.5cm，宽1.5cm，先端钝，基部图形、近心形或截形；边缘有不规则的圆锯齿或近全缘，两面均被白毛，或上面无毛。花小，排列成稀疏的总状花序；花萼杯状，5裂，裂片三角状卵形；花瓣5，淡黄色，卵形，长约为萼片的2倍，先端急尖；雄蕊10，着生于花盘外侧，花丝短；子房上位，3-4室，柱头头状，略3裂。核果倒卵形，长约1cm，具3棱，钝头，果皮肉质，肥厚，每室具种子1颗。花期4月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-wxdvr90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-wxdvr90","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.鲍达乳香树 小乔木，枝条被白毛或无毛。小叶15-21，长方披针形至长方形，长2-4cm，宽1-1.5cm，基部圆形或截形，全缘或有锯齿，两面均具白毛，或仅下面呈灰色毡状。总状花序；花白色或绿色，具浅钟状波密毛的花盘，半包围子房。果实未成熟时近锤形，基都变成窄柄状。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-33sw5qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-33sw5qm","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3．野乳香树 小乔木，高5-6m。树皮灰色。小叶17-21，革质，长方形，长1.5-4cm，钝头，具粗毛。圆锥花序；花甚小，淡血色，外面具毛；花丝下半部突然变宽呈鳞片状。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-g9iek83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-g9iek83","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-wupm7a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-wupm7a5","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品呈类球形或泪滴状颗粒，或不规则小块状，长0.5-2cm，有的粘连成团块，淡黄色，微带蓝绿色或棕红色，半透明。质坚脆，断面蜡样。气芳香，味极苦，嚼之软化成胶块。以淡黄色、颗粒状、半透明、无砂石树皮等杂质、粉末粘手、气芳香者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ngagdmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ngagdmj","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-cl361ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-cl361ay","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 乳香树含树脂60％-70％，树胶27％-35％，挥发油3％-8％。树脂的主要成分为游离a，β-乳香脂酸（a，β-boswellic acid）33％，结合乳香脂酸13.5 ％；乳香树脂烃（olibanoresene）33％，O-乙酰基-β-乳香脂酸（O-acetyl-β-boswellic acid），O-乙酰-a-乳香酯酸，3，4-断-乌苏-12-烯-3-羟酸（dihydroroburic acid），表羽扇豆酸乙酸酯（epilupeol acetate），表羽扇豆醇及甘遂酸（tirucallol）；树胶为阿拉伯杂多糖酸（arabic acid）的钙盐和镁盐20％，西黄芪胶粘素（bassorin）6％。此外，尚含苦味质0.5％；挥发油呈淡黄色，有芳香，含蒎烯（pinene），消旋-柠檬烯（limonene）及a，β-水芹烯（a，β-phellandrene），a-樟脑烯醛（a-campholenaldehyde），枯醛（cumi-naldehyde，cumaldehyde），荷罗艾菊酮（carvotanacetone），水芹醛（phellandral），邻-甲基苯乙酮（o-methylacetophenone），葛缕酮（carvone），紫苏醛（perilla-aldehyde），优葛缕酮（eucarvone），1-乙酰基-4-异丙烯基环戊烯（1-acetyl-4-isopropenyl cyclopentene），辣薄荷酮（piperitone，诺蒎酮（nopinone），隐品酮（cryptone），马鞭草烯酮（verbenone），γ-樟脑烯醛（γ-campholenaldehyde），侧柏酮（thujone），桃金娘酸（myrtenic acid），4-对盖烯-3-酮（p-menth-4－en-3-one），3，6，6-三甲基降-2-蒎酮（3，6，6-trimethynorpinan-2-one），桃金娘醛（myrtenal），2，4-二甲基苯乙酮（2，4-dimethylace-tophenone），松樟酮（pinocamphone），异亚丙基环乙烷（isopropylidenecyclohexane），a-香树脂酮（a-amyrenone），11-氧代-a-香树脂酮（11-keto-a-amyrenone），5-羟基-6-对？烯-2-酮（5-hydroxy-p-menth-6-en-2-one），10-羟基-4-荜澄茄烯-3-酮（10-hydroxy-4-cadi-nen-3-one）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-um7zkax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-um7zkax","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-phodrw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-phodrw8","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.镇痛作用：用小鼠热板法证明乳香挥发油有镇痛作用，提取挥发油后的残渣无效。挥发油中的镇痛主要成为乙酸正辛酯。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-louum4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-louum4q","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.消炎防腐作用：乳香能促进多核白血球增加，以吞噬死亡的血球及细胞，改善新陈代谢，从而起消炎作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-b4u58dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-b4u58dv","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-9ip71zg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-9ip71zg","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.乳香：拣去砂子杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-yb4jawn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-yb4jawn","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.取拣净的乳香，置锅内用文火炒至表面稍见熔化点，略呈黄色，取出放凉；或炒至表面溶化时，喷洒米醋，继续炒至外层明亮光透，取出放凉。（每乳香100斤，用米醋6斤）；置箬上，以灰火烘焙熔化，候冷，研细用；乳香入丸药，以少酒研如泥，以水飞过，晒干用；或言以灯心同研则易细，或言以糯米数粒同研，或言以人指甲二、三片同研，或言以乳钵坐热水中乳之，皆易细。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-xm9p9cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-xm9p9cr","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-gkculyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-gkculyr","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）本品遇水变白，与水共研成乳状液。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-79irs8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-79irs8w","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品1g，研碎，加甲醇10ml，振摇并放置24h，滤过，取滤液5ml，蒸干，残渣加稀硫酸10ml转移至分液漏斗中，有三氯甲烷20ml振摇提取2次，每次10ml。三氯甲烷提取液蒸干溶剂，残渣加1ml乙酸酐溶解，再加乙酸研-浓硫酸（19：1）试剂1ml，溶液很快变成紫色。（检查乳香酸）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-2on30n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-2on30n5","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-mhn471v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-mhn471v","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心；肝；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-lij2ohz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-lij2ohz","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ygiqox5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ygiqox5","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味辛；苦；微温"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-kiw1dkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-kiw1dkh","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-axmwzuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-axmwzuu","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。《本草经疏》：痈疽已溃不宜服，诸疮脓多时，未宜遽用。《本经逢原》：胃弱勿用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-ukyxmo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-ukyxmo7","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-66pd4ib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-66pd4ib","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 活血行气；通经止痛；消肿生肌。主心腹疼痛；风湿痹痛；经闭痛经；跌打瘀痛；痈疽肿毒；肠痈；疮溃不敛"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-5w2kb22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-5w2kb22","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-jnzpyt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-jnzpyt7","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-10g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-i8vxcfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-i8vxcfb","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-0hq0tlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-0hq0tlp","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 没药散《证治准绳》；乳香寻痛丸《奇效良方》；乳香丸《普济本事方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-grinsfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-grinsfs","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-j8yqqt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-j8yqqt5","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草纲目》：乳香香窜，入心经，活血定痛，故为痈疽疮疡、心腹痛要药。《素问》云：诸痛痒疮疡，皆属心火是矣。产科诸方多用之，亦取其活血之功尔。杨清叟云：凡人筋不伸者，敷药宜加乳香，其性能伸筋。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-xrtduy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-xrtduy1","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：风水毒肿，邪干心脾，恶气内侵，亦由二经虚而邪易犯。瘾疹痒毒，总因心脾为风湿热邪所干致之。脾主肌肉，而痛痒疮疡皆属心火，此药正入二经，辛香能散一切留结，则诸证白瘳矣。《日华子》云，煎膏止痛长肉；陈藏器云，治妇人血气，疗诸疮，令内消。则今人用以治内伤诸痛，及肿毒内服外敷之药，有自来矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-4rf4bpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-4rf4bpa","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草汇言》：乳香，活血去风，舒筋止痛之药也。陈氏发明云，香烈走窜，故入疡科，方用极多。又跌扑斗打，折伤筋骨，又产后气血攻刺，心腹疼痛，恒用此，咸取其香辛走散，散血排脓，通气化滞为专功也。故痈疡可理，折伤可续，产后瘀血留滞可行，症块痞积，伏血冷瘕可去矣。性燥气烈，去风活血，追毒定痛，除痈疡、产后及伤筋骨之外，皆不须用。4.《本草求真》：血因气逆，则血凝而不通，以至心腹绞痛，毒因气滞，则血聚而不散，以至痛处异常。乳香香窜入心，既能使血宣通而筋自伸，复能入肾温补，使气与血互相通活，俾气不令血阻，血亦不被气碍，故云功能生血，究皆行气活血之品耳。非如没药气味苦平，功专破血散瘀，止有推陈之力，而无致新之妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-q49zv9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-q49zv9q","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《医学衷中参西录》：乳香、没药，二药并用，为宣通脏腑、流通经络之要药，故凡心胃胁腹肢体关节诸疼痛皆能治之。又善治女子行经腹疼，产后瘀血作痛，月事不以时下。具通气活血之力，又善治风寒湿痹，周身麻木，四肢不遂及一切疮疡肿疼，或其疮硬不疼。外用为粉以敷疮疡，能解毒、消肿、生肌、止疼，虽为开通之品，不至耗伤气血，诚良药也。乳香、没药，最宜生用，若炒用之则其流通之力顿减，至用于丸散中者，生轧作粗渣入锅内，隔纸烘至半熔，候冷轧之即成细末，此乳香、没药去油之法。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-4gxyvmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-4gxyvmq","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614113450-2u3q1m6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113450-2u3q1m6","updated":"20240614113450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113451-ma6enhf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113451-ma6enhf"}},{"ID":"20240614113452-95q5vir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113452-95q5vir"}}]}